      },
      "text": "Flavours of Brazil: Rio Carnival, Paraty and Ilha Grande"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:lead:e3456bc1f4d270f4",
      "field": "lead",
      "sourceTextSha256": "63699a6a70b0e86029fdad33356ff507a6f91c6745f31f82b8a16d24d3312159",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-w3975dff5b107",
        "model": "GPT-6.1-Sol"
      },
      "text": "Over nine days, you’ll go up Sugarloaf Mountain and Corcovado, see samba schools perform at Carnival and continue along the Green Coast. In Paraty, visit waterfalls and a distillery and see how cassava flour is made. Then explore the beaches of Trindade and the islands of Angra dos Reis before spending two nights on Ilha Grande, including a visit to Lopes Mendes."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:priceNote:9b6b7f5cf7b1e557",
      "field": "priceNote",
      "sourceTextSha256": "ec2e77e641b6e24e61eeb557d67f10efd89299a81875797273c94bb5439d2988",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-w3975dff5b107",
        "model": "GPT-6.1-Sol"
      },
      "text": "From $1940 per person in a TWIN room for a group of 12+1, with stays at B & B Copacabana, Corsario and Vento Sul or similar accommodation. All six rates are listed in the table."
    },
